Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 02:54:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Docs: the external YOLOv26-FRC-Model hub counter plugin

YOLOv26-FRC-Model ships tbavid.fms_counter:ColourCounter and ComboCounter for
vision/run_vision.py. They were tested against this repo at 20524ce: plugin, rescore.py,
and the /control Vision panel. Nothing here said they existed or how to load them. The
README adds them to the counters table and gets a short section: what each does, what
it measured (10.1% / 6.8% on four scored 2026 Einstein broadcasts, with the caveats), a
vision.yaml example and the PYTHONPATH it needs. vision.example.yaml gets a commented
pointer. CLAUDE.md notes that the plugin is maintained there, not copied here.

The README's expected test count was 16 and the suite was already at 22; it now says 26.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
